#====================================================================
# DRAFT-kissfft-131-ohos-mpil-guard-testcpp
# 触发事件: kissfft 131 HarmonyOS PC 适配（R01 上游测试）
#          test/testcpp.cc 编译失败: M_PIl 未声明（OHOS libc 无 long double PI 宏）
#====================================================================

id:                     DRAFT-kissfft-131-ohos-mpil-guard-testcpp
trigger_tool:           clang++|make|test|libc|math.h
phase:                  compilation|testing
error_signature:        'use of undeclared identifier .M_PIl|M_PIl.*not declared|testcpp.*M_PIl'

severity:               2
category:               ohos|portability|upstream-test|long-double|libc
match_keywords:         OHOS, M_PIl, long double, pi constant, math.h,
                         undeclared identifier, upstream test, clang-15, aarch64,
                         libc, musl, test source, compile-time

title: 'OHOS upstream test sources referencing M_PIl directly fail to compile; guard-define the constant'

root_cause: >
  The OHOS libc (musl-based) math.h defines double constants M_PI/M_PI_2/M_PI_4 but
  not the long-double M_PIl macro. Upstream test sources (C or C++) that reference
  M_PIl directly inside formulas — without an `#ifdef M_PIl ... #else` assertion
  framework — fail at COMPILE time with 'use of undeclared identifier M_PIl'
  (not at runtime). This is a different trigger surface than gtest tests that wrap
  M_PIl in an #ifdef and ADD_FAILURE() at runtime.

solution: >
  Add a portable guard at the top of the test source, with the same value as glibc
  M_PIl:
    #ifndef M_PIl
    #define M_PIl 3.141592653589793238462643383279502884L
    #endif
  Applicable to upstream test sources that reference M_PIl directly with no
  #ifdef framework. Complementary to DRAFT-au-0.6.0-ohos-mpil-powl-float-tests
  (which handles gtest #ifdef M_PIl runtime-assertion scenarios with a constexpr
  replacement): guarded frameworks -> au constant replacement; bare references ->
  guard define. Do not delete/disable the test case; keep library code untouched.

verification_cmd: >
  clang++ -O2 -D_GNU_SOURCE -I.. -I../tools -o testcpp testcpp.cc -lm && ./testcpp
  (kissfft 131 R01: compile passes; testcpp runs with float/double/long double
  RMSE 1e-7..1e-31, exit 0; included in dual-caliber ledger 18/18)

rec_priority:           1
rec_approach:           mpil-guard-define
rec_description:        #ifndef M_PIl guard-define with glibc-equivalent long double value
                        in upstream test sources that reference M_PIl directly.
rec_auto_fix:           true
rec_impl:               test-portability-patch

fallback_priority:      2
fallback_approach:      document-platform-difference-only
fallback_description:   If patching upstream tests is not acceptable, record the
                        M_PIl absence as a platform reference difference in the ledger
                        without changing the test source.
fallback_auto_fix:      false
fallback_impl:          ledger-only

forbid_1_pattern:       M_PIl.*filter|exclude.*M_PIl|skip.*M_PIl
forbid_1_reason:        Disabling or filtering the failing test hides platform
                        portability evidence and is not a fix.
forbid_2_pattern:       #define M_PIl (2|3)\.1[0-4]|M_PIl.*1e-10
forbid_2_reason:        Wrong value or arbitrarily sloppy tolerance masks real
                        numeric regressions; must use glibc-equivalent value.

related:                DRAFT-au-0.6.0-ohos-mpil-powl-float-tests
similar_to:             DRAFT-au-0.6.0-ohos-mpil-powl-float-tests
path:                   B (knowledge extension; new compile-time trigger + guard-define
                        solution vs existing runtime-assertion draft)
dedup:                  doc/ miss; graph/ miss; drafts/ partial (au mpil-powl, different
                        trigger surface); error-patterns miss
affected_scope:         OHOS aarch64 C/C++ libs whose upstream test sources reference
                        M_PIl directly without an #ifdef framework
verification_evidence:  testcpp.cc compile+run PASS after guard; ledger 18/18;
                        W3 local CI green; conan create/verify PASS
pr_prefix:              【知识库扩展】
